  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Grand Sunsets - true luxury living in The Enclave at Inlet Beach. This townhome is a stunning retreat with a private pool, expansive Gulf views; only steps from beach access, elevator, and gourmet kitchen. If you're looking for an escape along 30A, this is your place. All 4 main bedrooms have private baths. Every bathroom is a true spa experience finished with gleaming white marble. The home is decked out from top to bottom with luxurious designer touches.<br><br>Walking into this beach retreat and from the oversized garage you'll find the 1st floor separate living quarters. This bonus area comes complete with full bath and kitchenette. There's a queen sleeper sofa and twin bunks. This room opens to your private courtyard retreat with heated pool* enclosed with privacy fence for outdoor entertaining or enjoying lazy pool days. You'll find plenty of seating and loungers plus a gas grill. This complete 2nd living area is a perfect separate retreat if you're traveling with multiple families (or teenagers!). And, there's a ping pong table in the garage!<br><br>Head to the stairs or elevator to the 2nd floor that includes 2 master king suites complete with private balconies and Gulf views. Plus there's a bunk room with twin-over-twin bunk beds and private bath.<br><br>Up on the 3rd floor you'll find the main living area and gourmet kitchen. No expenses were spared when it came to this kitchen. There's an oversized refrigerator, gas range, and beverage center complete with wine fridge. The elevator is located right off the kitchen to make bringing up groceries a breeze. There is seating for 5 at the kitchen counter and seating for 8 at the dining table (and of course more seating outside)<br><br>Head out to the balcony for al fresco dining. Take the spiral staircase up to the observation tower, catch a truly Grand Sunset, and enjoy an evening cocktail. This is by far the best spot in the house to catch the sunrises and sunsets along with those stunning Gulf views. Also on the 3rd floor is an additional master queen en suite and yet another private balcony.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS - SLEEPS 12<br><br>1st Floor, Bedroom 1: Queen sleeper sofa and twin-over-twin bunks, Smart TV. Full bath and kitchenette. Pool and courtyard access.<br><br>2nd Floor, Bedroom 2: Twin-over-twin bunk room. Private bath with tub/shower combo<br><br>2nd Floor, Bedroom 3: King bed, Smart TV. Balcony access and private bath with separate soaking tub and shower<br><br>2nd Floor, Bedroom 4: King bed, Smart TV. Balcony access and private bath with dual sinks and shower<br><br>3rd Floor, Bedroom 5: Queen bed, Smart TV. Balcony access and private bath with large shower<br><br>Looking for a beach day? Head right down the road and you'll have your toes in the sand in minutes (just 3 minutes!). On top of the easy beach access, the location can't be beat when it comes to shopping, dining, and entertainment. You're minutes from 30Avenue where you'll find no shortage of dining and shopping options. If you're looking to explore the area's natural beauty, Camp Helen State Park is practically right next door. Minutes from Rosemary Beach to the west and Panama City Beach to the east, you'll be pleased to have everything you could want at your fingertips.<br>* Parking for 3-4 cars<br>* Sorry, no pets allowed",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
